<section id="connect" class="section connect" aria-labelledby="connect-title">
<div>
<span class="eyebrow">LET’S KEEP IN TOUCH</span>
<h2 id="connect-title">Good things<br/>start with<br/>
<em>staying in touch.</em>
</h2>
<p>Receive community stories, programme updates, upcoming activities, and opportunities to get involved.</p>
<span class="community-note">Together, we grow.</span>
</div>
<div class="signup">
<h3>Stay connected</h3>
<label for="newsletter-name">Your name</label>
<input id="newsletter-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Full name" disabled=""/>
<label for="newsletter-email">Email address</label>
<input id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" disabled=""/>
<div class="consent">
<input id="newsletter-consent" type="checkbox" disabled=""/>
<label for="newsletter-consent">I would like to receive Al-Bustan Association’s newsletter by email.</label>
</div>
<button type="button" class="button" aria-describedby="newsletter-status" disabled="">Join our newsletter</button>
<p id="newsletter-status" class="fineprint">Newsletter sign-up will be available soon.</p>
<p class="fineprint">For newsletter enquiries or unsubscribe requests, email <a href="mailto:jer.est.albustan3@gmail.com">jer.est.albustan3@gmail.com</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
